{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301000/extras/DescriptionHeader.png?t=1744216651\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore The Vast White at your own pace</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a solitary snowboarding journey down a vast, untamed mountain where every run is unique. <i>The Vast White</i> blends exploration, storytelling, and the thrill of the descent into a seamless open-world adventure. With only your board and your instincts, carve through pristine alpine wilderness, uncover hidden trails, and unravel the secrets buried beneath the snow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f <strong>An Open Mountain to Conquer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ride at your own pace through sprawling peaks, frozen forests, and secluded valleys\u2014every path you choose reveals new wonders and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301000/extras/Untitled.gif?t=1744216651\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> \u2744\ufe0f <strong>Uncover the Mountain\u2019s Mysteries</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore every corner of the mountain to find hidden routes, and stunning landscapes that reveal the mountain's past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301000/extras/CaveSuperLow.gif?t=1744216651\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f <strong>Encounters on the Snow</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cross paths with wanderers, hermits, and fellow adventurers\u2014each with their own tales, quests, and clues to hidden routes. Will you help them, or focus on the ride ahead?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to explore <i>The Vast White</i>? Grab your board and take on the mountain like never before.</p>","background":"https://s